# The SINGLE source of the eval model pin (gianna's eval-models.env pattern):
# sourced by both `just evals` (locally) and .github/workflows/evals.yml (the
# schedule), so what the evals measure is one visible diff in one file — and
# local runs and scheduled runs measure the SAME chain. Matches the shipped
# default in tests/evals.rs; change both deliberately, together.
OPENROUTER_MODELS=deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro
